Like, the staging is one thing, but I usually perform by showing off dancing.

189
00:24:02,332 --> 00:24:09,932
バラードで挑戦するのってすごいなって思ってたんだよね。
So I thought challenging yourself with ballads was really amazing.

190
00:24:09,932 --> 00:24:14,332
あー、そっか。でもなんか自分にとってはバラードが一番声に似合うから。
Ah, I see. But for me, ballads fit my voice the best.

191
00:24:14,332 --> 00:24:20,932
そう、なんか、もっと見せたいなとは思ってて。
Yeah, so I wanted to showcase that more.

192
00:24:20,932 --> 00:24:23,432
あ、そっか。
Ah, I see.

193
00:24:23,432 --> 00:24:28,432
